In article <1990Nov08.093722.10596@lut.fi> lassus@lut.fi (Henry Lassus) writes:

   If you have a lot of experience and hp and want to offer do this
   1. Get a cursed scroll of genocide
   2. Get a poor weapon (the weapon is going to corrode)

Or get a rust-proof weapon ...

   3. Go to your altar

3a. Take actions to make sure the puddings can't attack you
    (The black pudding's bite is bad news on more than your weapons ...)

   4. Read cursed Genocide scroll. 
   5. You want black puddings. (sent in some black puddings)
   6. Use the poor weapon and hit the pudding. The pudding didvides.
	   (and the weapon corrodes)
   7. Kill the new pudding and offer it.
   8. Dont kill them all. You may have to wait that puddings regenerate.
   9. You can offer as much as you want and you get some good things.
	   (my friend found a wand of wishing from dead black pudding)

A similar thing can be done at sinks.  Stand next to the sink, take measures to
prevent attacks, kick the sink until a pudding appears ... voila!  Lots of
experience points, and other goodies!

	   Happy Hacking.

